{"id":"c45c7513cbdebbfa","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-perfect-tree.md","title":"Perfect Tree and Perfect Kernel","display":"df-perfect-tree — Perfect Tree and Perfect Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-perfect-tree","aliases":["62-df-perfect-tree"],"display":"df-perfect-tree — Perfect Tree and Perfect Kernel","depends_on":["[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-df-finite-sequence]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions V.4.1, VI.1.2","source_pages":[185,218],"source_pdf_pages":[203,236]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-perfect-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-perfect-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-perfect-tree — Perfect Tree and Perfect Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions V.4.1, VI.1.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>203</span><span>236</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>树与序列见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,T\">\\(P,T\\)</span> 为数的集合。下面是谓词定义，不假定所有 T 的完美核存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\ns\\perp t&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(t)\\land\\neg(s\\preceq t)\\land\\neg(t\\preceq s),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(P)\\land\\forall s\\in P\\exists t,u\\in P\\;(s\\preceq t\\land s\\preceq u\\land t\\perp u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Kernel}(P,T)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)\\land P\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall Q\\;[(\\mathsf{Perfect}(Q)\\land Q\\subseteq T)\\to Q\\subseteq P].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\ns\\perp t&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(t)\\land\\neg(s\\preceq t)\\land\\neg(t\\preceq s),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(P)\\land\\forall s\\in P\\exists t,u\\in P\\;(s\\preceq t\\land s\\preceq u\\land t\\perp u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Kernel}(P,T)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)\\land P\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall Q\\;[(\\mathsf{Perfect}(Q)\\land Q\\subseteq T)\\to Q\\subseteq P].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空树也是完美树。Kernel 指最大完美子树：若它存在，任意两个候选互相包含，因而唯一。定义量化已有的完美子树；不把不存在于当前模型中的第三阶子树族之并当作已给定集合。需要非空完美子树的命题必须另加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(P\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions V.4.1, VI.1.2；纸面页 185, 218；PDF 页 203, 236。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树与序列见 [[62-df-Tree]]、[[62-df-finite-sequence]]；$P,T$ 为数的集合。下面是谓词定义，不假定所有 T 的完美核存在。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树与序列见 [[62-df-Tree]]、[[62-df-finite-sequence]]；$P,T$ 为数的集合。下面是谓词定义，不假定所有 T 的完美核存在。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\ns\\perp t&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\mathsf{Seq}(t)\\land\\neg(s\\preceq t)\\land\\neg(t\\preceq s),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(P)\\land\\forall s\\in P\\exists t,u\\in P\\;(s\\preceq t\\land s\\preceq u\\land t\\perp u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Kernel}(P,T)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Tree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{Perfect}(P)\\land P\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall Q\\;[(\\mathsf{Perfect}(Q)\\land Q\\subseteq T)\\to Q\\subseteq P].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P\\ne\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1591,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-perfect-tree|Perfect Tree and Perfect Kernel]]"},{"id":"d2ab3c6a8160fff4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-Pi1-CA0]]，树见 [[62-df-Tree]]，Kernel 见 [[62-df-perfect-tree]]，$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；树路径指标刻画见 [[62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences]]。$\\mathrm{PK}$、$\\mathrm{PK}_2$ 在下式引入。"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-perfect-tree]]"}],"outgoing":["bb825000fd9a8272","b7164631e6f56192"]}